replayshield (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.4.0.
  * Move auth storage from single DB file to per-user encrypted DB files
    under /var/lib/replayshield/users/*.db.enc.
  * Update authentication flow to open only the target user's DB file.
  * Update manage CLI flows (add/manage/delete/dump) for per-user DB layout.
  * Add admin marker based key-verification and legacy single-DB migration path.
  * Keep benchmark default at 500 measured iterations and seed one benchmark user.

 -- YoungJin Ko <kyj9447@gmail.com>  Wed, 11 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000

replayshield (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.3.1.
  * Add login-notify PAM helper script to package payload.
  * Add systemd [Install] metadata and improve maintainer script behavior in
    non-systemd environments.
  * Standardize PAM hook path/documentation to /usr/lib/replayshield.
  * Remove benchmark actual-db mode; benchmark now runs on isolated temporary DB only.
  * Expand benchmark mock data to 10 users x 100 passwords (1000 tuples total).
  * Increase default benchmark measured iterations from 50 to 500.
  * Remove benchmark admin-password prompt and print default test login credentials.
  * Reorganize packaging shell scripts under packaging/package-scripts/.

 -- YoungJin Ko <kyj9447@gmail.com>  Wed, 11 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000

